   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">So, you&#39;re not using Shiny&#39;s <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">selectInput</font>? Are you writing your own <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">tags$select()</font>? For non-input/output tags, there&#39;s no problem using <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">HTML()</font>, but for Shiny inputs and outputs, you need to use the appropriate <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">xxxInput</font> and <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">yyyOutput</font> functions in Shiny, otherwise there will be no reactivity baked in...</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
